00:00:56.513 --> 00:00:58.094
- (bleep)

00:00:58.094 --> 00:00:58.905
- I'm into that.

00:00:58.905 --> 00:01:00.727
- This might be very weird.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.689
- Ooh, that smells really good.

00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:04.106
- It does look like maple syrup.

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:05.970
- Oh man, this is scary.

00:01:06.877 --> 00:01:08.707
- Eweew.

00:01:08.707 --> 00:01:11.041
- Smoother, but it's not,
like, the flavor of bacon.

