00:01:26.883 --> 00:01:29.350
- Oh, I only eat bananas
to be a good person.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:30.372
- I love bananas.

00:01:30.372 --> 00:01:32.091
- Umm, that kinda smells
like, like breakfast.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:33.228
Kinda smells like pancakes.

00:01:33.228 --> 00:01:35.477
- I figure this is gonna
taste like (bleep).

00:01:37.459 --> 00:01:38.345
- [Guy] Yeah.
- [Gal] Umm hmm.

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:39.344
- [Guy] Yep.
- [Gal] Umm hmm.

00:01:39.344 --> 00:01:40.784
- Oh, this is so good.

00:01:40.784 --> 00:01:42.340
- This is genius.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:43.663
- It's getting the whole tongue.

00:01:43.663 --> 00:01:45.576
- It's sweet and salty.

00:01:45.576 --> 00:01:46.270
- Yeah.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:47.563
