00:01:47.563 --> 00:01:49.938
- There isn't enough of this in the world.

00:01:49.938 --> 00:01:51.309
- I'd do that.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.472
- Like at the end of most drunk nights,

00:02:03.472 --> 00:02:05.068
I just wanna make bacon anyway.

00:02:05.068 --> 00:02:06.037
- Cheers.

00:02:06.037 --> 00:02:08.111
- Ooh, that is good.

00:02:08.111 --> 00:02:09.528
- You taste it when you breathe out?

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:11.476
- It's like, makes it
just easier to drink.

00:02:11.476 --> 00:02:12.826
- It's putting hair on my chest.

00:02:12.826 --> 00:02:14.114
- It makes it more
special than the average

00:02:14.114 --> 00:02:15.592
