00:02:21.595 --> 00:02:23.492
why not get drunk off bacon?

00:02:23.492 --> 00:02:24.812
- I'm drunk already.

00:02:24.812 --> 00:02:28.075
- [Both] I like it, I love
it, I'll eat some more of it.

00:02:28.075 --> 00:02:28.898
- [Guy in blue] Bacon.

00:02:28.898 --> 00:02:30.928
I just want you to know
this is a very special

00:02:30.928 --> 00:02:32.877
time in my life, and I'm
just so glad I can be

00:02:32.877 --> 00:02:34.398
sharing it with you.

00:02:34.398 --> 00:02:35.384
- [Girl in black] Are you falling in love?

00:02:35.384 --> 00:02:36.508
- [Guy in blue] Yeah, I am in love.

00:02:36.508 --> 00:02:37.874
With bacon.

00:02:37.874 --> 00:02:38.753
I'm in love with bacon.

00:02:38.753 --> 00:02:40.260
- Bacon love.

